      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220495/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat cream in a chilled glass or metal bowl with an electric mixer. Gradually add confectioners' sugar and vanilla extract, continuing to beat until stiff peaks form.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DctwScT4Rsq-0lrRY8o969iapk4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220495-zebra-cake-iii-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-3361-2f9338603a9e4738a18300108102caa7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220495/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread a generous teaspoon of whipped cream onto each cookie.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1UyfyjZz6mTRRFwURCF9uHGSA6E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220495-zebra-cake-iii-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-3363-1f8741486d564765bed33ca2911f9c60.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220495/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press cookies together to make 3-inch stacks.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/13vlYOVzo5vDs_C_3MvB9AhLJlA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220495-zebra-cake-iii-ddmfs-4x3-step-06-3365-8f59a2f31a184a27825e15aef10de997.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220495/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread whipped cream in a 1-inch-wide line down the center of a serving platter. Turn cookie stacks sideways and join into a log; place in the whipped cream to secure.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tzN99ri3ZbCs4l-x2oA4pb6KhYU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220495-zebra-cake-iii-ddmfs-4x3-step-08-3377-f54ac3a87f804f689daec459d77c8b2f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220495/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Frost cookie log with remaining whipped cream and sprinkle with grated chocolate. Cover tightly and refrigerate, 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YGJiz_m3ClGSHukCjUEwvDNr4GI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220495-zebra-cake-iii-ddmfs-4x3-step-10-3383-00876028924a4d5fa6f8550fe5d260b1.jpg"
